Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.53,0:03:47.95,Dates,Onscreen,0,0,0,,{\fad(444,390)}October 13th, Stellar Year 2148
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.67,0:03:55.79,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,We can't possibly make it \Nacross this, can we?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.79,0:03:57.26,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.57,0:04:00.12,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,What, are we talking \Nabout our Juggernauts?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.54,0:04:04.34,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,There are all kinds of little gaps in the cockpits. \NThe water will come flooding right in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.86,0:04:10.00,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Well, Haruto, Daiya, or Kujo \Nmight've just jumped in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.00,0:04:11.85,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.61,0:04:17.82,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,Man, it's been a long three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.82,0:04:21.15,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,With all those recon units out, \Nit was bound to be tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.15,0:04:25.07,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,But we were able to keep the wind and rain off, \Nwhich was a big help.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.07,0:04:27.84,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,We've been out on this special recon mission \Nfor what, two weeks?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.84,0:04:31.05,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,We've lasted longer than I thought. \NI assumed we'd die on the first day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.05,0:04:32.30,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.30,0:04:33.98,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,So, where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.98,0:04:37.66,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,No idea. We shut off our location trackers \Na long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.11,0:04:41.75,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,So this is freedom, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.93,0:04:45.76,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,So what's the plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.76,0:04:48.19,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,If we want to go forward, \Nwe need to use a bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.19,0:04:50.45,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,But those recon units might come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.45,0:04:51.13,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.83,0:04:54.35,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,do we really need to go forward right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.55,0:04:58.67,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.67,0:05:00.18,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,I'd like to do the wash.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.18,0:05:02.61,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,And we're not in a big hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.98,0:05:37.14,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,It feels like... \Nwe're the last people left alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.24,0:05:39.15,Main,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.77,0:05:43.94,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,"If the last thing I see is this, \Nthen maybe that's not so bad." Was that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.53,0:05:45.95,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,How long ago was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.34,0:05:49.27,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,I never took you for a romantic.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.27,0:05:50.28,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.42,0:06:02.41,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,I don't think they're dead, \Nbut when they die, they just disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.02,0:06:05.09,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Their mind, their will... \NThey don't stay behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.79,0:06:08.24,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Like the ones that went before us?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.80,0:06:09.60,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.13,0:06:11.77,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,How many are there, now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.05,0:06:13.70,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,576.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.96,0:06:15.32,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Including your brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.79,0:06:16.69,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.52,0:06:18.47,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.34,0:06:22.50,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Hey, what about his name?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.76,0:06:24.07,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Did you leave it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.52,0:06:25.56,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.56,0:06:26.62,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,When?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.06,0:06:28.46,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Fido knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.37,0:06:31.53,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,You two really are close.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.52,0:06:35.68,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Now it's just a question of \Nhow far we can take them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.06,0:06:39.97,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Without resupply, there's a limit\N to how long we can keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.34,0:06:43.76,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,In other words, \Nhow many days we can survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.76,0:06:44.87,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.39,0:06:47.79,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Anything you're going to regret?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.15,0:06:51.50,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,The Major asked you once, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.50,0:06:53.25,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,If there was anything you wanted to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.25,0:06:55.90,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,places you wanted to go, \Nthings you wanted to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.28,0:06:57.09,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,You said—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.09,0:06:58.48,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,What did I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.26,0:07:04.25,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,That you'd never even thought about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.89,0:07:07.48,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Then my answer's still the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.03,0:07:13.02,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.93,0:07:21.34,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,We finally got to do the wash.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.59,0:07:27.63,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,All we really need now is a big barrel \Nor something to put some water in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.63,0:07:29.07,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.97,0:07:31.33,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,What is it, Fido?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.54,0:07:33.66,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,If you're talking about your container,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.66,0:07:37.39,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,we might be able to compensate \Nfor the lousy welding by patching it with cloth,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.39,0:07:41.06,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,but we can't heat the amount of water \Nit would take to fill that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.25,0:07:43.41,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,We don't have the fuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.48,0:07:48.74,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,I know we all miss baths, \Nbut I don't see how it's possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.74,0:07:51.94,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,How can you understand him that well?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.42,0:07:55.23,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,There's a town nearby?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.58,0:07:57.94,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Well, I won't stop you from looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.94,0:08:00.70,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,Seriously, how can you tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.06,0:08:03.74,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,Is it okay, Shin? Taking a bath...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.01,0:08:06.43,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,We're not going anywhere in particular.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.84,0:08:10.48,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,And we should be in\N old Imperial territory by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.83,0:08:14.93,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,I'd like to see what their towns were like.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.24,0:08:17.99,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,Kurena, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.39,0:08:19.49,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.67,0:08:23.23,Main Top,Kurena,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.23,0:08:23.75,Main Top,Anju,0,0,0,,No worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.46,0:08:26.85,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,They look like ordinary kids, \Nwalking together like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.75,0:08:24.60,Main Top,Theo,0,0,0,,Anything good?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.60,0:08:26.85,Main Top,Kurena,0,0,0,,Something that would've looked good on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.14,0:08:29.31,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Well, the same goes for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.31,0:08:34.33,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,We were all just ordinary kids \Nfrom different towns.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.81,0:08:38.24,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Without the war, we never would've met.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.11,0:08:43.92,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,The Giadian Empire... \NDoes it bring back any memories for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.92,0:08:48.75,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,No. My parents were born in Giadian, \Nbut I've never been here before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.05,0:08:51.57,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,I don't really remember my parents at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.57,0:08:54.07,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,It just seems like a strange place to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.07,0:08:55.31,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.31,0:09:00.80,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Well, some really distant ancestors of mine,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.18,0:09:04.96,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,but it's not our homeland, either, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.89,0:09:11.86,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.03,0:09:23.84,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Don't run off on your own. \NYou're not a little kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.34,0:09:27.13,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,It's nothing. We're probably fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.13,0:09:30.32,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,They haven't noticed us, \Nand we're not going to run into them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.74,0:09:32.24,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,You mean the Legion?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.24,0:09:33.35,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.71,0:09:37.12,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,You tired?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.12,0:09:40.05,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,If you want to rest, \Nthat pillbox is a pretty good hiding spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.31,0:09:42.83,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,I think it's safe to relax a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.96,0:09:47.34,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.34,0:09:48.32,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.63,0:09:52.51,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,I told you. I'm used to \Nhearing the Legion's voices.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.51,0:09:56.96,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,There are more voices now that \Nwe're inside their territory, but it's not that bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.96,0:09:59.13,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,You say that, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.13,0:10:00.36,Main Top,Kurena,0,0,0,,There you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.36,0:10:02.37,Main Top,Theo,0,0,0,,Don't get lost! Are you little kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.37,0:10:04.44,Main Top,Anju,0,0,0,,Oh, are we interrupting?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.44,0:10:07.04,Main Top,Kurena,0,0,0,,Look, look! Fido found something!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.48,0:10:08.45,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Since we're not fighting, \Nit's easier now, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.81,0:10:10.05,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.70,0:10:15.73,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.41,0:10:21.34,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,It's so warm!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.57,0:10:25.61,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,Kurena, if you're too loud, \Nthe Legion will find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.61,0:10:27.70,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,It feels good, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.70,0:10:30.01,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,And it's probably going to cool off, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.24,0:10:33.63,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,The boys should've joined in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.63,0:10:35.66,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,That's why, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.98,0:10:38.76,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,The reason you always get treated \Nlike a little sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.59,0:10:42.87,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,I'm not a little sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.10,0:10:45.91,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,If we all got in together, \Nwe could wash each other off!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.91,0:10:49.08,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,It would be {\i1}efficient{\i0} and {\i1}hygienic{\i0}, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.08,0:10:51.41,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,Are you maybe saying that deliberately?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.41,0:10:52.62,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,"Deliberately"?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.88,0:10:54.90,Main Top,Anju,0,0,0,,You don't know what that word means?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.68,0:10:59.99,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Shin, why do you think Kurena never matured?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.26,0:10:59.02,Main Top,Kurena,0,0,0,,Is it something you can eat? \NIs it yummy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.30,0:11:02.64,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.64,0:11:04.61,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,I'm glad we were able to take a bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.61,0:11:06.72,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,It's thanks to Fido finding that boiler.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.36,0:11:11.96,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,The Imperials ran off and left the fuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.96,0:11:16.31,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,Nine years later and it's still usable. \NThey were using the good stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.59,0:11:18.79,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Thanks to that, \Nwe were able to enjoy a bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.16,0:11:20.97,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Good job finding it, Fido.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.69,0:11:39.20,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,I don't think I've ever seen him \Nsleeping that peacefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.89,0:11:42.07,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,He's been laughing a lot lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.07,0:11:45.27,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,Yeah. It's like his expression is...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.27,0:11:47.09,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,Softer now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.09,0:11:49.08,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,He's telling more jokes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.08,0:11:52.44,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,And playing along with Raiden's \Nand my dumb comments.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.71,0:11:57.62,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,I'm sure he's at peace, \Nnow that he's finally achieved his goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.95,0:11:59.32,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,His brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.62,0:12:03.59,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,He spent five years looking for him \Nbefore finally putting him to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.23,0:12:05.71,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,And being free.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.23,0:12:14.60,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,And at the very end, he finally found someone \Nhe could entrust himself to.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.96,0:12:19.04,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,"We're going on ahead, Major," was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.13,0:12:23.49,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,Our Reaper was lonely, wasn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.49,0:12:26.71,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,Having all his comrades die before him \Nand being forced to carry them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.71,0:12:32.86,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,So it was good for him, \Nbeing able to leave those words behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.63,0:12:37.36,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,It kind of ticks me off, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.99,0:12:42.07,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,It's good, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.07,0:12:43.16,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,But?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.16,0:12:48.51,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,It feels like he has nothing left.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.99,0:12:53.58,Dates,Onscreen,0,0,0,,{\fad(488,475)}October 14th, Stellar Year 2148
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.16,0:12:51.92,Main Top,Raiden,0,0,0,,A little, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.31,0:13:04.82,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,That idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.76,0:13:12.52,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,His Juggernaut's still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.52,0:13:14.38,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,He didn't go on without us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.69,0:13:17.45,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,But he took his rifle and handgun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.45,0:13:18.85,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,What about the Para-RAID?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.85,0:13:20.32,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,He turned it off right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.04,0:13:23.51,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,Any idea where he might've gone, Fido?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.42,0:13:29.41,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Maybe there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.59,0:13:33.24,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,It's a zoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.24,0:13:34.34,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.34,0:13:35.59,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Don't ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.59,0:13:37.32,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,But we don't have any better options.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.78,0:13:45.15,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.31,0:13:48.48,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,They're kind of like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.58,0:13:55.56,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,Shin!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.19,0:14:07.48,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Shin!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.35,0:14:09.88,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.88,0:14:11.20,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,It's fine, Raiden.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.20,0:14:12.36,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,There's no danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.02,0:14:14.73,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,It can't move at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.78,0:14:19.25,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,I could tell it was approaching us, \Nlittle by little, for a while now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.75,0:14:21.77,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,It didn't seem to be a scout,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.77,0:14:25.44,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,and we were going in different directions, \Nso I was going to ignore it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.56,0:14:29.19,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,But it felt like it was calling me. \NSince yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.52,0:14:32.03,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Calling you? Then it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.29,0:14:35.10,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,An Eighty-Six, just like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.10,0:14:38.59,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,We can't communicate, \Nbut I can hear its voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.24,0:14:41.56,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,So, what's it saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.56,0:14:43.10,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,What are its last words?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.20,0:14:49.37,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,"I want to go home."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.97,0:15:03.02,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.26,0:15:06.62,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,You can go home now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.75,0:15:17.95,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Raiden, if there are any other surviving countries \Nbesides the Republic...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.38,0:15:20.74,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,I've heard that story a few times.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.74,0:15:27.24,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Beyond the old borders, beyond Legion territory, \Nthere are places where the Legion don't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.24,0:15:30.31,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,You mean if there are any survivors there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.67,0:15:31.85,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.85,0:15:34.60,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,You want to go there and live in peace?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.60,0:15:36.72,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,I couldn't even imagine what that'd be like.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.72,0:15:42.28,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,In a fairy tale, journeys like this end \Nwith you arriving in paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.28,0:15:45.76,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Paradise? Or heaven?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.76,0:15:50.63,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,If I could count on something like that, \NI would've blown my own head off ages ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.58,0:15:54.76,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,Are we going to die like this, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.57,0:16:08.19,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,"Stop talking and go forward," is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.26,0:16:15.31,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,You're being bossy, Fido!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.31,0:16:17.81,Main Top,Theo,0,0,0,,What is Fido, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.81,0:16:19.41,Main Top,Anju,0,0,0,,He's not just a dog that beeps, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.12,0:16:19.41,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.32,0:16:22.73,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,going to the other side \Nof the water alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.06,0:16:31.69,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Never mind. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.60,0:17:31.36,Flashback,Shin,0,0,0,,You're still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.37,0:17:40.59,Flashback,Shin,0,0,0,,The squadron, your friends... \NThey're all gone, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.38,0:17:43.52,Flashback,Shin,0,0,0,,Even so...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.03,0:17:46.56,Flashback,Shin,0,0,0,,Will you go back with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.64,0:18:03.39,Flashback,Soldier,0,0,0,,This is your new pigsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.23,0:18:11.84,Flashback,Soldier,0,0,0,,You've got six months left.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.84,0:18:15.89,Flashback,Soldier,0,0,0,,Work hard until the very last minute, Eighty-Six.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.45,0:18:24.17,Flashback,Soldier,0,0,0,,You're the last one. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.29,0:18:30.16,Flashback,Soldier,0,0,0,,Look this way, pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.60,0:18:46.84,Flashback,Daiya,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.67,0:18:52.23,Flashback,Soldier,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.56,0:18:55.49,Flashback,Shin,0,0,0,,Can I ask you a favor?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.81,0:18:59.01,Flashback_Italics,Lev,0,0,0,,So you're the Reaper's buddy, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.84,0:19:02.91,Flashback_Italics,Lev,0,0,0,,Stay with him until the end, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.41,0:19:08.28,Flashback,Kujo,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.28,0:19:11.38,Flashback,Lev,0,0,0,,No! Wipe that off, you stupid kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.53,0:19:14.69,Flashback,Kujo,0,0,0,,You know what this means?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.09,0:19:17.55,Flashback,Kujo,0,0,0,,I bet you don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.92,0:19:21.98,Flashback,Kurena,0,0,0,,When I tripped today, Shin grabbed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.98,0:19:24.56,Flashback,Kurena,0,0,0,,His hand touched my back! \NDid you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.01,0:19:30.30,Flashback,Kaie,0,0,0,,Fido, I have a question for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.65,0:19:33.07,Flashback,Kaie,0,0,0,,Do you know which tastes worst?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.07,0:19:35.31,Flashback,Lekka,0,0,0,,A machine wouldn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.83,0:19:38.28,Flashback,Lekka,0,0,0,,How did he know?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.78,0:19:41.08,Flashback,Kaie,0,0,0,,It's so bad \Nthat even Fido can tell, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.34,0:19:43.82,Flashback,Haruto,0,0,0,,I don't know how we ate that stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.65,0:19:48.20,Flashback,Lev,0,0,0,,Fido, those parts that came in yesterday...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.68,0:19:50.84,Flashback,Lev,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.42,0:19:54.38,Flashback,Kujo,0,0,0,,That's right now. No meaning at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.38,0:19:56.61,Flashback,Kujo,0,0,0,,The stars, the sky, the wind...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.61,0:19:59.21,Flashback,Kujo,0,0,0,,They've got nothing to do with any of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.21,0:20:01.08,Flashback,Kujo,0,0,0,,They're just there and always have been.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.96,0:20:03.30,Flashback,Kujo,0,0,0,,You understand that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.85,0:20:17.25,Flashback,Haruto,0,0,0,,Fido, you get it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.25,0:20:19.88,Flashback,Haruto,0,0,0,,I just wanted to take a peek!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.88,0:20:22.40,Flashback,Daiya,0,0,0,,That's right. Fido gets it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.40,0:20:25.13,Flashback,Theo,0,0,0,,Wait, is Fido a guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.01,0:20:29.79,Flashback,Kaie,0,0,0,,You like pretty flowers?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.79,0:20:31.64,Flashback,Kaie,0,0,0,,Are you a little girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.12,0:20:35.64,Flashback,Kaie,0,0,0,,No, I guess boys can like flowers, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.66,0:20:38.41,Flashback,Kaie,0,0,0,,My favorite flower is...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.97,0:20:48.10,Flashback,Kurena,0,0,0,,Shin paid me a compliment today!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.10,0:20:49.71,Flashback,Kurena,0,0,0,,We were fighting and then...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.72,0:20:52.73,sign_29964_255_Seeing_them_will,Sign,0,0,0,,Seeing them will change your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.01,0:20:56.03,Flashback,Anju,0,0,0,,"Change your life"? \NYou can't change your life that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.83,0:20:58.00,Flashback,Anju,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.78,0:21:01.77,Flashback,Daiya,0,0,0,,Fido, the aurora!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.77,0:21:03.67,Flashback,Daiya,0,0,0,,Let's set off for the north pole!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.00,0:21:07.44,Flashback,Daiya,0,0,0,,Well, you can't change your life \Nthat easily, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.01,0:21:09.57,Flashback,Daiya,0,0,0,,But something will change.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.07,0:21:13.95,Flashback,Daiya,0,0,0,,Do you think \NI can change things for her?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.05,0:21:39.94,Flashback,Kurena,0,0,0,,What can I do for him?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.50,0:21:47.86,Flashback,Shin,0,0,0,,So, I want you to survive until then.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.61,0:21:53.27,Flashback,Haruto,0,0,0,,A special recon mission \Nwith the five of them would be a ton of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.74,0:21:55.31,Flashback,Haruto,0,0,0,,You'll come along, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.06,0:21:57.01,Flashback,Haruto,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.77,0:22:09.47,Flashback,Theo,0,0,0,,I'm amazed I've made it this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.22,0:22:12.98,Flashback,Theo,0,0,0,,I wonder if I'll be next.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.17,0:22:17.39,Flashback,Theo,0,0,0,,This time, I'll die, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.10,0:22:19.79,Flashback,Lev,0,0,0,,Thank you for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.77,0:22:23.19,Flashback,Lev,0,0,0,,Keep them safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.36,0:22:30.70,Flashback,Shin,0,0,0,,I'm happy for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.79,0:22:40.64,Flashback,Haruto,0,0,0,,Everybody smile!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.64,0:22:43.21,Flashback,Haruto,0,0,0,,This'll be the last photo you ever take!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.47,0:22:44.46,Flashback,Haruto,0,0,0,,Three,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.73,0:22:45.67,Flashback,Haruto,0,0,0,,two,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.95,0:22:47.16,Flashback,Haruto,0,0,0,,one!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.63,0:23:01.42,Flashback,Shin,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.84,0:23:06.89,Flashback,Shin,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.42,0:23:27.80,Dates,Onscreen,0,0,0,,{\fad(439,478)}October 30th, Stellar Year 2148
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.59,0:23:37.65,Main,Lena,0,0,0,,"Here we go."
